+PIPE_FORMAT_X8B8G8R8_SRGB         , plain, 1, 1, x8  , un8 , un8 , un8 , wzy1, srgb
+PIPE_FORMAT_B8G8R8A8_SRGB         , plain, 1, 1, un8 , un8 , un8 , un8 , zyxw, srgb
